from filename "../../module/ffmpeg_hear.pya" ob name microphone hear to name hear be import do
exists su name ffmpeg input ob text "lavfi" be default ya
exists su name ffmpeg input device ob text "anullsrc=r=16000:cl=mono" be default ya
exists su name keyboard bin ob text "true" be default ya
su name prompt ob text "Focus the target app now. Recording 1 second from ffmpeg input before typing the transcript." be write do
su name note ob text "Override 'ffmpeg input' and 'ffmpeg input device' to use your microphone." be write do
su name transcript from wo microphone during num 1 to filename "/tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be hear do
su name typed ob name transcript to wo keyboard be write do
